*5 [[Those Guys]] spawn after 16.67 seconds<sup>500f</sup>, delay 8.33~16.67 seconds<sup>250f~500f</sup>.
*1 [[The Perfect Cyclone]] spawns as the boss after 30 seconds<sup>900f</sup>.
*Infinite [[Those Guys]] spawn after 50 seconds<sup>1,500f</sup>, delay 13.33~26.67 seconds<sup>400f~800f</sup>.
*10 [[Trolly Blogger]]s spawn after 66.67 seconds<sup>2,000f</sup>, delay 10~20 seconds<sup>300f~600f</sup>.
*Infinite [[Trolly Blogger]]s spawn after 100 seconds<sup>3,000f</sup>, delay 26.67~53.33 seconds<sup>800f~1,600f</sup>.
*Infinite [[Doge Dark]]s spawn after 133.33 seconds<sup>4,000f</sup>, delay 66.67~200 seconds<sup>2,000f~6,000f</sup>.
*Infinite [[Trolly Blogger]]s spawn after 166.67 seconds<sup>5,000f</sup>, delay 40~80 seconds<sup>1,200f~2,400f</sup>.
*Infinite [[Doge Dark]]s spawn after 200 seconds<sup>6,000f</sup>, delay 100~200 seconds<sup>3,000f~6,000f</sup>.

==Strategy==
As with [[Oncoming Storm (Insane)|Oncoming Storm]], [[Kotatsu Cat (Super Rare Cat)|Octopus Cat]] (as Sadako rather than Octopus due to faster attack rate) can utterly break this stage, provided the Cyclone is weakened by it. Tanky attackers such as [[Crazed Titan Cat (Super Rare Cat)|Crazed Titan Cat]] or [[Sushi Cat (Super Rare Cat)|Roe Cat]], or quick units such as [[Swimmer Cat (Super Rare Cat)|Fishman Cat]], [[Express Cat (Super Rare Cat)|Maglev Cat]] or [[Crazed Cow Cat (Super Rare Cat)|Crazed Cow Cat]] can break into the blind spot and destroy it quickly.

Note that due to the Trolly Bloggers, it is recommended to use the default [[Cat Cannon]] or Crazed Cow/Manic Lion as a way to remove them quickly. [[Nerd Cat (Super Rare Cat)|Cyberpunk Cat]] can help with this along with slowly chipping away at The Perfect Cyclone's health. [[Sniper the Deadeye]] can be used simalarly to Cyberpunk Cat to stall and knockback the cyclone, though make sure the cyclone is weakened and you have at least 1 Sadako Cat on field so he doesnt kb the cyclone into attacking range whilst not weakened.

Unit Speed Up or Unit Defense Up [[Cat Combo|Combos]] can help, as it helps with the chance of units making it into the Cyclone's blind spot. Overall, strategies that work for Oncoming Storm can also work for this stage.

Using [[Crazed Titan Cat (Super Rare Cat)|Manic Jamiera Cat]] with Octopus or Sadako is the best way to beat this stage, granted you have enough user rank to make Manic Jamiera level 25 or higher.

